DESCRIPTION:Come to the Live@DCC Free 2nd Friday noon concert series May 8\, featuring the folk duo\, Jaeger & Reid\, at the Davis Community Church\, 4th and “C” Streets! Hearkening from the San Francisco Bay Area\, Judi Jaeger’s Canadian background\, striking vocals and intelligent songs combine with Bob Reid’s California upbringing and his own engaging\, original and collected tunes. Their delicate\, rich harmonies and artful blending of guitars and ukulele deliver an intimate afternoon of deeply meaningful music.
