SUMMARY:Natural Wines by the Glass
DESCRIPTION:🍊🍷 Natural Wines by the Glass 🍷🍊\n📅 Friday\, May 8 | 12–5pm\nCurious\, creative\, and full of personality—step into the world of Black Bicycle Farm’s natural wines at Great Bear Vineyards. 🌿✨\nFor one special afternoon\, enjoy your choice of five expressive natural wines by the glass\, each crafted from organically grown grapes with minimal intervention\, allowing the vineyard\, vintage\, and winemaker’s artistry to shine through.\nWhether you’re already a natural wine enthusiast or simply wine-curious\, this is your chance to sip something unexpected\, memorable\, and full of character.\n🍇 What to Expect:\n✨ Your choice of five unique natural wines\n✨ Wines that tell the story of the vineyard and vintage\n✨ A glimpse into the creativity and philosophy behind natural winemaking\n✨ A relaxed afternoon in the rustic beauty of the winery\n🍷 Featured Wines Include:\nSquiggle 2023 – Bold and structured orange wine with layered citrus and textured depth\nOrange Tipple 2023 – Fragrant elderflower\, vibrant apricot\, honey\, and orange notes\nClash of the Titans 2022 – Cabernet Sauvignon & Zinfandel blend bursting with red and dark fruit harmony\nAfter the Fire 2020 – Cabernet Sauvignon harvested during the 2020 wildfires—smoky\, spicy\, and unforgettable\nCarbo Cab 2019 – Playful\, unfiltered Cabernet with Bing cherry\, candied strawberry\, and lively carbonic charm\n🍃 Join us for an afternoon of innovation\, sustainability\, and seriously delicious wine.\n✨ Nature made it interesting—we just poured it by the glass
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/natural-wines-by-the-glass/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/5-8-26-Thumbnail.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
GEO:38.5818013;-121.7499687
