SUMMARY:The Sun Followers & Italian Brother's Pizza
DESCRIPTION:🎶🍷 Live Music & Food Truck at the Vineyard 🍕✨\n📅 Friday\, May 8 | 5–8pm\nEase into the weekend with a Friday night full of music\, wine\, and wood-fired pizza in the beautiful vineyard setting. 🌿🌅\nJoin us for an unforgettable evening featuring the romantic melodies of The Sun Followers\, a talented acoustic harmony duo whose songs are made to break\, melt\, and mend the heart. Pair their soulful sound with a glass of your favorite estate-grown wine\, and you’ve got the perfect recipe for a relaxing night out.\n🎟 Ticket Includes:\n🍷 Glass of Wine\n🎶 Live Music\n🎵 Music by The Sun Followers\nStraight from Chico\, California\, this acoustic vocal harmony duo blends classic covers with catchy original songs to create the perfect soundtrack for your evening under the vines.\n🍕 Food Truck: Italian Brother’s Pizza\nCome hungry! Enjoy authentic wood-fired pizza made with fresh\, high-quality ingredients. From timeless classics to specialty creations\, each pizza is cooked to perfection in a traditional wood-fired oven.\n✨ Great wine\, live music\, delicious pizza\, and vineyard sunsets—what more could a Friday need?\nGrab your tickets and join us for a night to remember! 🍷🎶
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/the-sun-followers-italian-brothers-pizza/
